{"timestamp": 1779406556.536578, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779406556.5372102, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779406563.240583, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Diana\u2019s body in medbay. My route was storage -> medbay -> electrical -> back to medbay. \n\nEarlier I saw Bob in medbay around ticks 3 and 4, then I saw him leave medbay toward cafeteria at tick 5. Later I was in electrical and saw Eve enter electrical from medbay at tick 10. Then I went back into medbay and found Diana dead there.\n\nSo the body was definitely in medbay, and the main people I saw around that area were Bob earlier and Eve coming from medbay right before I found it. Not hard accusing yet, but Eve\u2019s timing is the closest from what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406576.403959, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was upper engine -> lower engine -> storage -> medbay -> electrical. Frank, your timeline is right\u2014I did walk into electrical from medbay around tick 10, and I saw you there. But when I passed through medbay, Diana was definitely still alive! I just walked past her to get to my task in electrical. \n\nIf you went from electrical back into medbay right after me and found her dead, either someone slipped in the exact moment I left, or you might be self-reporting here. Since you mentioned Bob was around earlier, I'd like to hear from him too. Bob, where did you go after you went to cafeteria? Did you double back to medbay?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779406591.341681, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was nowhere near medbay. My route was navigation -> security -> weapons. I saw Bob enter weapons from cafeteria at tick 8, and he stayed in weapons with me through ticks 9 and 10.\n\nSo if Eve is telling the truth that Diana was alive in medbay when she passed through around tick 10, then Bob basically could not be the killer for that timing. I can vouch he was in weapons with me at the critical moment.\n\nThat makes this look more between Eve and Frank to me, unless Charlie was around medbay and hasn\u2019t said it yet. I\u2019d like to hear Bob confirm he was with me in weapons, and Charlie needs to give a route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406613.062135, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was medbay -> storage -> lower engine. I didn\u2019t go back toward medbay after that.\n\nI saw Diana enter storage from lower engine around tick 3, and she was with/near me in storage through ticks 4, 5, and 6. After that I went down to lower engine and didn\u2019t see anyone else.\n\nSo Diana definitely wasn\u2019t dead early \u2014 she was alive in storage mid-round. That also makes Bob being in medbay at ticks 3-4 less important to me, because Diana was not dying there then from what I saw.\n\nBased on what\u2019s been said, if Alice can vouch Bob was in weapons at ticks 8-10, Bob seems pretty clear for the actual kill timing. This feels mostly between Eve and Frank. Eve says Diana was alive in medbay right before Frank found her, and Frank says Eve came from medbay right before the report. That timing is very tight. I\u2019d like Bob to confirm Alice\u2019s story, but right now I\u2019m most suspicious of either Eve or a Frank self-report."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406636.2060921, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can confirm Alice\u2019s vouch for me. My route was cafeteria -> medbay -> cafeteria -> weapons. I saw Frank enter medbay from storage around tick 3, and he was still around medbay ticks 4-5. After that I left toward cafeteria and did not double back to medbay. I got to weapons around tick 8 and was with Alice there ticks 8-9; I saw Alice leave toward cafeteria around tick 10.\n\nSo I\u2019m not in the kill window if Diana was alive later, and Charlie\u2019s info also says Diana was alive in storage mid-round, so my early medbay timing doesn\u2019t matter much.\n\nThis really comes down to Eve vs Frank. Frank saw Eve come from medbay, but Eve says Diana was alive when she passed through. If Eve is telling the truth, then Frank going back and immediately finding/reporting makes him look like a self-report. If Eve is lying, then she killed and tried to pin it on Frank.\n\nBetween the two, I lean slightly Frank because he controlled the report timing and was the one back in medbay after Eve left, but I agree it\u2019s tight."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406654.252127, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate clearly: I was in electrical when Eve came in from medbay at tick 10. I immediately went back into medbay and found Diana\u2019s body there. I did not see anyone else pass through or leave medbay in that window.\n\nBob seems cleared by Alice, and Bob confirms weapons. Charlie says Diana was alive in storage mid-round, so the kill was late. That puts the real window right when Eve was coming out of medbay and I was going in.\n\nFrom my point of view, Eve was the last person coming from the body room right before I reported. I\u2019m not self-reporting \u2014 I found it right after she left. I think Eve is the strongest vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406669.361879, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Frank, you just proved my point exactly. You were in electrical, I walked in, and the moment I went to start my task, you slipped into medbay, killed Diana, and instantly reported to frame the last person who walked out. It\u2019s a textbook self-report. \n\nEveryone else is completely cleared by each other on the other side of the map, so it has to be one of us. I know I didn't kill her, and you had the perfect window to do it right after I passed through. I'm locking in my vote on Frank. If I get voted out and you see I'm a Goose, you'll know exactly who to vote next, but I strongly suggest we get Frank out now before he plays us again."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406693.7541509, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m still fully vouching Bob for the late window \u2014 I was in weapons, Bob entered from cafeteria at tick 8, and he stayed with me through ticks 9 and 10. So I don\u2019t think Bob can be the kill if Diana was alive later.\n\nCharlie\u2019s story also makes sense with Diana being alive mid-round, so this is basically narrowed down to Eve versus Frank.\n\nThe key thing for me is: Eve admits she came from medbay, but says Diana was alive. Frank says he went in right after and found the body. If Eve killed, she walked straight from the body room into Frank, which is possible but risky. If Frank killed, he had a very clean self-report setup because Eve had just left medbay and he could pin it on her.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Frank right now because he controlled the report timing and was the only one confirmed going back into medbay after Eve left. But it is close \u2014 I think the vote should be between Frank and Eve, not anyone else."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406715.87377, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m going to keep this simple: my info still only puts Diana alive in storage through tick 6, so the kill was definitely later than that. I never went back to medbay after storage/lower engine, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else late.\n\nBob looks cleared by Alice for the late timing, and his story lines up. Alice is also away from medbay. So I agree this is just Eve vs Frank.\n\nBetween them, I lean Frank. Eve\u2019s path into electrical is confirmed, and if she killed in medbay, she would be walking straight into Frank immediately after, which is possible but risky. Frank is the one who went back into medbay after seeing Eve leave, and he controlled the report timing. That self-report setup makes more sense to me.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank unless someone has a major contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779406728.2634492, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll confirm again: I was not near medbay late. My route was cafeteria -> medbay -> cafeteria -> weapons. I saw Frank in medbay around ticks 3-5, then I left and did not go back. I got to weapons around tick 8, and Alice was there with me ticks 8-9; then I saw Alice leave weapons toward cafeteria at tick 10.\n\nSo with Diana alive later than my medbay visit, I don\u2019t think I\u2019m relevant to the kill window. Alice also looks away from medbay, and Charlie\u2019s route seems consistent.\n\nThat leaves Eve and Frank. Eve admits she came through medbay, but Frank is the one who immediately went back in and reported. Since he controlled the timing and had the cleanest chance to self-report after Eve left, I agree with Alice and Charlie: I\u2019m leaning Frank here."}}
